# QIS College of Engineering and Technology - Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE MAPS API KEY CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Get your API key from Google Cloud Console:
#    https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/overview
# 2. Enable these APIs in Google Cloud Console:
#    - Maps JavaScript API (Required for interactive map)
#    - Places API (Required for location search & autocomplete)
#    - Geocoding API (Required for address lookup)
#    - Distance Matrix API (Optional for road distance & duration)
# 3. Paste your API key below:
# ==============================================================================
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE
